{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：华海清科二季度营收超预期，中国半导体设备开支上调15%至79%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS最新研报把中国半导体资本开支的预期大幅上调，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>区间从原先估计提升<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">79%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">820亿美元</span>。这份覆盖华海清科的报告中，最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的不是单季业绩本身，而是背后对中国存储扩产和先进制程研究的重新定价。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">华海清科<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.4亿元</span>人民币，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">39%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，比GS和彭博一致预期分别高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>。毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43.6%</span>，同样高于两边预期。营收超预期主要来自中国半导体资本开支扩张，毛利率改善则反映了产品结构向先进节点设备升级的速度比预期更快。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVmjfZNhRibdeKhAafngKYo9qxwfiaWNAr61gic9gl3WlG6MxRDOlianicFSv0CfyzEowx0oR0CpVicMAMT9zXUGh9Cst3febkDLYR8g/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>经营利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>，但净利润只增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把利润表拆开看，经营利润334百万元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">48%</span>，比预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>。但净利润316百万元，同比只增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，基本符合预期。差距来自非经营性收入<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>只有37百万元，而去年同期是79百万元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里有个值得留意的结构：主营业务的盈利能力在快速提升，但非经营项目影响了净利润表现。GS在调整盈利预测时也<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>到了这一点，把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>净利润预测下调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，但<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看经营利润和净利润的增速差，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">58%</span>对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，这个差距主要来自非经营收入的变化，不是主业出了问题。简单说，公司卖设备赚钱的能力在增强，但报表上的其他项目波动会干扰单季利润读数；我更关注后续季度经营利润能否维持这个增速，那才是判断主业趋势的干净信号。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXsznpdV96yqhgTYOpVYXibqhOY576Hkibn1CTNeosMBD4owZjT3DHL2Qf31X7eZlzU6rqqTa3nIIBj28wLiaVmwNlbRNDBwdm7CU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 中国半导体资本开支上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">79%</span>，存储是主要推手</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS在CHIPS IV主题报告中把<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>中国半导体资本开支预测上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">79%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">820亿美元</span>。同时预测中国晶圆制造设备支出在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至2028年分别增长13%、20%和15%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">驱动因素有两个：一是存储厂商扩产，二是先进制程研究增加，两者都服务于生成式AI带来的需求增长。报告还预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>中国将新增每月<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">600万</span>片8寸和12寸晶圆产能，从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">700万</span>片增至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1400万</span>片。这个产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>节奏，直接决定了设备厂商未来几年的收入能见度。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW1j7OjMQXdyicNrldWZg0eukAsic2KNw8rDzbqmHeeFWRTMuuyOyFNNototWiaXoQsLQs4jgvtPtiaictgq7VHskHUEvX830dLqBoQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 先进节点CMP设备占比提升，毛利率预期跟着上调</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS把华海清科<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>收入预测分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，主要依据是先进节点CMP设备的贡献增加。毛利率预测也相应上调，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>分别从42.5%和42.6%上调至42.8%和43.1%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">产品结构升级的逻辑并不复杂：先进节点对CMP设备的工艺要求更高，对应设备的单价和毛利率也更高。华海清科作为国产CMP设备主力供应商，在中国半导体设备国产化率提升的背景下，先进节点订单占比上升会直接<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>盈利质量。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 毛利率上调的幅度不大，但方向比幅度更重要。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWf0exzp0mkpnMWTmxaRHkmG5yNXl48J0ENqWcn3qeJxRqcOfiaNCIfE40mOwhACSAwItrlMia2LVSsUGMHBQVaBo3HRUicianIcI8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 35-GS-Hwatsing -688120-- China Semi capex uptrend driving shipments growth ahead- 2Q26 OP beat- 报告观点-260825</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
